{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49407","headline":"薄命女 · 和凝","name":"薄命女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天欲晓，宫漏穿花声缭绕。\n窗里星光少。\n冷露寒侵帐额，残月光沈树杪。\n梦断锦帷空悄悄，强起愁眉小。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《人间词话》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/人間詞話）"}